# D1 GIVEN hasStorage=Yes and the moving-day-stop answer is No, WHEN scope is
#    assembled, THEN storage size/fullness contributes its existing cube only;
#    drive time remains origin-to-destination, no stop leg or 0.75 load hour is
#    added, and no storage-route disclosure is emitted.
# D2 GIVEN the moving-day-stop answer is Yes and the optional storage address
#    resolves, WHEN scope is assembled, THEN drive time is the sum of
